{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/23bdbd43318751e6e7cc1344ce1357fc.webp?t=1768464514\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras_big/23bdbd43318751e6e7cc1344ce1357fc.avif?t=1768464514 width=800 height=59 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer will be included in Early Access. The demo is single-player only.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Bad Choices, Create Chaos!</strong><br> <br>Drink, stumble, steal, and smash your way through a world where bad decisions lead to the best stories. Lose control, unlock absurd antics, and turn your neighborhood into your personal playground - with or without your drinking buddies. <br><br><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do Stupid Things</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Open Map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Stats (BAC)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with Everything</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonshine Brewing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fist Fighting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Economy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunken Expression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunk Cooking</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/bae7a0dbecfd06c68604f0e52d693f79.poster.avif?t=1768464514\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/bae7a0dbecfd06c68604f0e52d693f79.webm?t=1768464514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Chug another beer and watch the world bend to your drunken logic.\u00a0The more you drink, the more stupid things you can do!  Raid a house and walk away with an entire barbecue grill... if you can carry it, it's yours! Climb rooftops or ride a stolen shopping cart straight into trouble. Will you remember it tomorrow? Probably not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/1528618aba4a207565662bf1cbed9759.poster.avif?t=1768464514\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/1528618aba4a207565662bf1cbed9759.webm?t=1768464514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> Raid their fridge, pee in their pool, crash their party or light the barbecue on fire at 3 a.m. See how long you can get away with it before someone calls the cop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/755ec0bb6e3553d55eab2d5e3787bd54.poster.avif?t=1768464514\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/755ec0bb6e3553d55eab2d5e3787bd54.webm?t=1768464514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You and your favorite drinking buddies can team up to turn every dumb idea into a shared disaster. Who needs plans when you\u2019ve got beer, bad judgement, and wingmen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/3cca80c01fd861570d63a3789877e190.poster.avif?t=1768464514\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/3cca80c01fd861570d63a3789877e190.webm?t=1768464514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Sip a beer and casually prank your neighbors, or down moonshine and turn the entire town upside down. Whether you\u2019re a harmless drunk or a full-blown menace is up to you.\u00a0 <br>     <br>    <br><strong>Will You Become a Local Legend?</strong>     <br>Wreak havoc, pull off legendary stunts, drive drunk, and make sure the NPCs never forget your drunken adventures. No consequences, no regrets\u2014just a whole lot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab a (virtual) drink, stumble into the unknown, and make a glorious mess in the ultimate sandbox of drunken stupidity!\u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras/c626a3587d63c881c9c674cb0116e414.avif?t=1768464514\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/extras_big/c626a3587d63c881c9c674cb0116e414.avif?t=1768464514 width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440390?t=1768464514","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440390?t=1768464514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440390/5b34d8340177f08de72b024a9bbbd965f30639a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768464514","capsule